# Vercel only serves the Vite front end (dist/). Everything below must NOT be
# bundled or it will blow the function size limit — the Python API is deployed
# separately on Render.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: without it, Vercel's auto-detection scoops up api/
# (now ~650 MB with the full PennyLane + Qiskit install) and tries to bundle
# it as a serverless function, failing with "Total bundle size exceeds the
# maximum function size (500 MB)."

# Backend — deployed on Render, not Vercel
api/

# Local training / data artefacts (none of these ship to users)
af2/
notebooks/
docs/

# Python virtual environments (if present anywhere)
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local build output and cache
.vercel/
.vite/

# Attachments and large committed data not used by the SPA
*.pdf
*.npz
*.ipynb

# Dev / editor cruft
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.DS_Store
*.log
